{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/7093145c4fdd248373708c831e98881c.avif?t=1767200643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras_big/7093145c4fdd248373708c831e98881c.avif?t=1767200643 width=800 height=450 /></span>From zero to hero! Run and race to the finish line. Collect coins, diamonds, and cash before time runs out, or compete against your opponents. Embark on a treasure hunt, but stay alert for dangerous creatures and cunning bandits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your hunger, thirst, or health drop too low! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/d198f2702cfdeee9a1615552e3123f08.avif?t=1767200643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras_big/d198f2702cfdeee9a1615552e3123f08.avif?t=1767200643 width=800 height=450 /></span>You can purchase food to survive, backpacks to carry more items, keys to unlock new apartments, vehicles to drive, an axe, as well as a variety of cool and funny cosmetics and outfits! Explore and travel to other maps through the Air Travel Agency to advance your career. Experience the thrill, savor the excitement, and dive into the action and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/222c246bbe3970fb5d9e8bf3b241755f.avif?t=1767200643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras_big/222c246bbe3970fb5d9e8bf3b241755f.avif?t=1767200643 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Funny Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu